  "conclusion": "In release mode, a no-signal pi approximation at i32::MIN returns zero and poisons the shared constant cache. Subsequent ordinary-precision queries return zero and certified_rational_interval(-64) returns an interval below 3, which excludes pi. All three clean controls and six poisoned processes repeat; prewarming does not prevent poisoning.",
